@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@webhookSecret = whsec_local_dev_secret
@invoiceId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000

### Listar faturas
GET {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/invoices

### Processar webhook de pagamento
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/payment
Content-Type: application/json
x-webhook-secret: {{webhookSecret}}

{
  "externalId": "evt_pay_0001",
  "type": "invoice.paid",
  "invoiceId": "{{invoiceId}}"
}

### Executar rotina de cobrança recorrente
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/run-billing-job
